# Unit13
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit13核心词汇

discuss/dɪˈskʌs/讨论/We need to discuss this problem in detail.
disease/dɪˈziːz/疾病/Regular exercise can prevent many diseases.
dismiss/dɪˈsmɪs/解雇；驳回/The boss dismissed him for being late.
display/dɪˈspleɪ/展示；陈列/The museum displays ancient artifacts.
dispute/dɪˈspjuːt/争论；争端/The two countries are involved in a territorial dispute.
distance/ˈdɪstəns/距离/The distance between the two cities is 200 km.
distinct/dɪˈstɪŋkt/不同的；明显的/There are two distinct types of this plant.
distinguish/dɪˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ/区分/It's hard to distinguish the twins.
distribute/dɪˈstrɪbjuːt/分配；分发/The teacher distributed the test papers.
district/ˈdɪstrɪkt/区；地区/This district is known for its seafood.
disturb/dɪˈstɜːrb/打扰/Please don't disturb me while I'm sleeping.
dive/daɪv/潜水；跳水/He dived into the swimming pool.
diverse/daɪˈvɜːrs/多样的/The city has a diverse population.
divide/dɪˈvaɪd/划分；除/Divide the cake into eight pieces.
document/ˈdɑːkjumənt/文件/Please sign the official document.
dog/dɒɡ/狗/The dog is very loyal to its owner.
dollar/ˈdɑːlər/美元/The book costs ten dollars.
domestic/dəˈmestɪk/国内的；家庭的/Domestic flights are usually cheaper.
dominant/ˈdɑːmɪnənt/占主导地位的/English is the dominant language in business.
donate/doʊˈneɪt/捐赠/She donated blood to the Red Cross.
door/dɔːr/门/Please close the door behind you.
doubt/daʊt/怀疑/I have no doubt that he will succeed.
down/daʊn/向下/She sat down on the chair.
downtown/ˌdaʊnˈtaʊn/市中心/They went shopping downtown.
draft/dræft/草稿；草案/He wrote the first draft of his essay.
drag/dræɡ/拖；拽/He dragged the heavy box across the floor.
drama/ˈdrɑːmə/戏剧/She studied drama at university.
draw/drɔː/画；吸引/The artist drew a beautiful landscape.
dream/driːm/梦想；做梦/Her dream is to become a doctor.
dress/dres/连衣裙；穿衣/She wore a beautiful red dress to the party.
drift/drɪft/漂流/The boat drifted slowly down the river.
drink/drɪŋk/喝/Would you like something to drink?
drive/draɪv/驾驶/He drives to work every day.
drop/drɒp/掉落；下降/Temperatures will drop sharply tonight.
drown/draʊn/溺水/The child nearly drowned in the river.
drug/drʌɡ/药物；毒品/Drug abuse is a serious problem.
dry/draɪ/干燥的/The clothes are dry now.
due/djuː/到期的；由于/The report is due next Monday.
dull/dʌl/无聊的；迟钝的/The lecture was dull and boring.
dump/dʌmp/倾倒；垃圾场/They dump waste into the river.
durable/ˈdjʊrəbl/耐用的/This bag is made of durable material.
during/ˈdjʊrɪŋ/在…期间/She fell asleep during the movie.
dust/dʌst/灰尘/She wiped the dust off the table.
duty/ˈdjuːti/责任；税/It is our duty to protect the environment.
dwell/dwel/居住；详述/Don't dwell on past mistakes.
dynamic/daɪˈnæmɪk/动态的；有活力的/She is a dynamic and energetic leader.
each/iːtʃ/每个/Each student has a textbook.
eager/ˈiːɡər/渴望的/She is eager to learn new things.
ear/ɪr/耳朵/She has a good ear for music.
